# Web Push for the local tests only (F4; committed on purpose, loaded by scripts/test-env.mjs after .env.test,
# whose values win). A key pair generated for these tests (web-push generateVAPIDKeys): never use it anywhere
# else. LP_PUSH_ALLOW_LOCAL lets subscriptions point at a local fake push service (https://127.0.0.1); the
# server honours it only while the Supabase URL is local, so it can never apply in production. Kept out of
# .env.test, which every worktree rewrites for its own local stack (skip-worktree, never committed).
